## FAQs

### How much does audio visual hire cost near me?

Pricing depends on the package: our full catalog, from the Eco Pack for small private parties up to the MICE Pack for large conferences, is listed with exact euro pricing on our [packages page](/packages/). All rates are ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout, and every price includes delivery, setup and teardown.

### What is included in an audio visual hire package?

Every package includes delivery, professional setup, testing and teardown, so you never handle the equipment yourself. The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) also include a technician on site for the hours that matter. See the exact inclusions per package on our [packages page](/packages/).

### What is the difference between dry hire and full service AV hire?

Dry hire is equipment only, with no delivery, setup or technician. We do not operate that way: every Malaga Event Gear package is delivered, installed and tested by our crew, and collected again afterward. See [Dry Hire vs. Full Service AV Hire](#dry-hire-vs-full-service-av-hire) above.

### How many guests can your AV packages support?

It scales with the package: the Eco Pack covers up to 50 guests, the Wedding Pack up to 80, the Basic MICE Pack up to 40, and the MICE Pack up to 120. See the full comparison in [Comprehensive Audio Visual Packages for Every Event](#comprehensive-audio-visual-packages-for-every-event) above.

### Can audio visual equipment be used outdoors?

Yes. We regularly set up sound and lighting for beach ceremonies, villa terraces and rooftop events across the Costa del Sol. For setup specifics, see [Audio Visual Rental for Outdoor Events](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-outdoor-events/).

### What is the difference between hiring AV equipment and hiring a DJ?

A DJ hire covers music and a DJ console. AV hire covers what a DJ alone does not: PA sound reinforcement, presentation screens, and wireless or gooseneck microphones for speeches. Our packages combine both where an event needs it, such as a wedding with a DJ set and speeches running through the same sound system.

### Do you serve areas outside Malaga city?

Yes. We deliver across the wider Costa del Sol, including Marbella, Fuengirola, Torremolinos, Benalmadena, Estepona, Mijas, Nerja and Antequera, with wider reach to Sevilla and Granada. See [Costa del Sol Coverage, Not Just Malaga City](#costa-del-sol-coverage-not-just-malaga-city) above.
